other_moves.detail:
Pace each A320 step-down to NGSA's proven rate. Where customers are waiting and the NGSA line has not yet held its next rate on its quality KPIs, the A320 line keeps its current step (never above 82 a month) rather than NGSA being pushed. Conditions:
- the A320 line's own quality KPIs hold;
- any added LEAP-1A and GTF tail volume is contracted without drawing on fleet spares;
