- no new buyback authority before 2037;
- no equity raise;
- state money is never in the case [AX-0022, AX-0102, AX-0001].

DISCLOSURE:
- progress against milestones in windows ('the second half of the 2030s');
- no internal long-term-plan targets and no state money;
- no word of Delay Tactics;
- no more maturity claimed than the record supports: 'a technology and production system we have been maturing' [AX-0004, AX-0005, AX-0020].

